# Patterns to ignore when building/linting/templating the chart.
# Helm loads everything under the chart root by default - anything CI
# tooling downloads or extracts into this directory (kubeconform, etc.)
# needs to either live outside the chart root entirely, or be excluded
# here as a second line of defense. See NOTES.md: a stray
# kubeconform.tar.gz left in the repo root by an earlier ci.yml bug
# broke every helm lint/template call in the validate job with
# "chart file ... is larger than the maximum file size 5242880".
.git/
.github/
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
kubeconform
kind
.helmignore
